---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "@/layouts/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/layouts/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions · ALC Cars">
	<Header />

	<main class="flex-1 bg-orange-50 px-4 py-12">
		<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl card bg-white shadow-xl p-8 sm:p-10 space-y-10">
			<header class="space-y-2">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Terms & Conditions of Car Rental</h1>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: September 2026</p>
			</header>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Purpose of the agreement</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					ALC Cars rents vehicles to drivers who meet the requirements set out
					in these terms. By confirming a booking, the customer accepts these
					terms and conditions in full, together with the fuel policy and any
					other specific conditions applicable to the booking.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Driver requirements</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
					<li>A minimum age of 21 years.</li>
					<li>A valid driving license held for at least 1 year.</li>
					<li>
						An International Driving Permit (IDP) for drivers whose license was
						not issued in the European Union or in a country with a valid
						reciprocity agreement.
					</li>
					<li>
						Drivers under 25 may be subject to a young driver surcharge
						depending on the vehicle category.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Required documentation</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					At pickup, the main driver must present a valid driving license, a
					national ID or passport and, where applicable, the credit card
					associated with the booking. Failure to provide valid documentation
					will prevent delivery of the vehicle with no right to a refund.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Bookings and payment</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					The booking is confirmed when the booking process is completed on the
					website. The final price corresponds to the result of the booking
					process for the selected dates and vehicle. Any additional charges
					(surcharges, refueling, damage, fines) will be charged to the card
					provided at pickup.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Pickup and return</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					Pickup takes place at the ALC Cars office at Alicante-Elche Airport
					(ALC) within the hours indicated on the booking. The vehicle must be
					returned to the same office, within the contracted period and in the
					same condition in which it was delivered, apart from normal wear and
					tear. Late returns may incur additional charges.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Cancellations</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					Free cancellations are available according to the conditions shown at
					the time of booking. To cancel or amend a booking, contact us on +34
					965 123 456.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Fuel and mileage</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					We apply a full-to-full fuel policy. All vehicles include unlimited
					mileage. See the
					<a href="/legal/fuel-policy" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">fuel policy</a>
					for more detail.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Insurance</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					All rentals include basic liability insurance. The customer may
					purchase optional cover to reduce or eliminate the excess. The vehicle
					must be returned undamaged; otherwise, the repair cost will be charged.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">9. Incidents and fines</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					The customer is responsible for the vehicle during the rental period.
					Fines, penalties and management charges arising from traffic offenses
					or the loss of documentation during the rental will be charged to the
					customer.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">10. Governing law</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					These terms are governed by Spanish law. For any dispute, the parties
					submit to the courts and tribunals of the city of Alicante.
				</p>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</BaseLayout>